<title>POLAND: Prochem Q1 net rises to PLN 1.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Prochem Q1 net rises to PLN 1.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochem SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.07   vs    0.21</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.73   vs    1.06</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.01   vs    0.69</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Prochem SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     17.76   vs    6.99</p>
<p>    costs of sales			14.33   vs    6.30</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.72   vs    0.37</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.48   vs    2.81</p>
<p>    financial costs			3.83   vs    1.96</p>
<p>    investment			     0.32   vs    0.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
